### Traits

- `Debug`: Full debug output with all fields
- `Clone`: Creates a deep copy
- `Serialize`: Converts to JSON/TOML/other formats
- `Deserialize`: Parses from JSON/TOML/other formats
- `PartialEq`: Compares instances for equality
- `Eq`: Reflexive equality relation

