## Design Patterns Used

### Builder Pattern

For complex types with many optional fields:

```rust
let config = ConfigBuilder::new()
    .name("test")
    .timeout(30)
    .verbose(true)
    .build()?;
```

### Default Trait

All types implement `Default`:

```rust
let instance: {{ classes.0.name }} = Default::default();
```

### Serde Integration

Full serialization support:

```rust
let json = serde_json::to_string(&instance)?;
let parsed: {{ classes.0.name }} = serde_json::from_str(&json)?;
```

